t to reiterate that the impact on -- from tariff on Federal Signal that were imposed during the last 18 months or so is nominal.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/federal-signal-fss-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"FSS 2019 Q3","e":"fss","d":"2019-10-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jennifer Sherman","x":"We source an insignificant percentage of our components that are affected by the tariffs that were introduced.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/federal-signal-fss-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"FSS 2019 Q3","e":"fss","d":"2019-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jennifer Sherman","x":"…our orders in any given quarter can vary due to a number of factors, including the timing of receiving large orders, including fleet orders from both domestic and international customers, the availability of customer-supplied chassis, our own lead times and the timing of price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/federal-signal-fss-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"FSS 2019 Q3","e":"fss","d":"2019-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Walter Liptak","x":"Was there a price increase that they were getting in front of?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/federal-signal-fss-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"FSS 2019 Q4","e":"fss","d":"2020-02-27","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jennifer Sherman","x":"For example, while many companies were adversely affected by the imposition of tariffs in 2018, our team's proactive approach to pricing and procurement largely neutralized the impact of higher material costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/28/federal-signal-fss-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"FSS 2019 Q4","e":"fss","d":"2020-02-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jennifer Sherman","x":"Several of our businesses have annual price increases that take effect in January 1.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/28/federal-signal-fss-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"FSS 2019 Q4","e":"fss","d":"2020-02-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jennifer Sherman","x":"And we haven't seen a lot of pushback with respect to those price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/28/federal-signal-fss-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"FSS 2020 Q1","e":"fss","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jennifer Sherman","x":"So, we worked with the local management team, and we put together a productivity plan that was significantly less than February to accommodate labor availability, need for safety, supply chain challenges, and we laid off a number of people.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/30/federal-signal-fss-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"FSS 2020 Q1","e":"fss","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ian Hudson","x":"And as we talked about some of the cost reduction initiatives that we took in the early part of the second quarter, those were designed with the goal of operating within those target ranges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/30/federal-signal-fss-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"FSS 2020 Q4","e":"fss","d":"2021-02-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jennifer L. Sherman","x":"So they have the ability to pass on price increases and steel surcharges as necessary.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/25/federal-signal-corp-fss-q4-2020-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"FSS 2020 Q4","e":"fss","d":"2021-02-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Christopher Paul Moore","x":"Just trying to get a sense of the ability to pass-through how quickly you can reprice if you have much steel inventory, so at this point in time?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/25/federal-signal-corp-fss-q4-2020-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"FSS 2020 Q4","e":"fss","d":"2021-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jennifer L. Sherman","x":"On the flip side, we are anticipating that some of the cost savings that resulted from actions taken in 2020 are expected to return in 2021, representing an estimated year-over-year expense headwind of approximately $8 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/25/federal-signal-corp-fss-q4-2020-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"FSS 2021 Q1","e":"fss","d":"2021-05-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jennifer L. Sherman","x":"Our teams are working diligently to mitigate the impacts of rising commodity costs by implementing price increases and surcharges where possible.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/federal-signal-corp-fss-q1-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"FSS 2021 Q1","e":"fss","d":"2021-05-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jennifer L. Sherman","x":"We didn't hear a lot of that back from our sales channel and our price increase, because of the rising commodity costs, the price increases have taken a somewhat of a regular pattern this year, compared to a more kind of stable commodity market.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/federal-signal-corp-fss-q1-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"FSS 2021 Q1","e":"fss","d":"2021-05-05","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Robert Stephen Barger","x":"Can you just kind of help us quantify the impact of chassis production on guidance -- of the maintain guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/federal-signal-corp-fss-q1-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"FSS 2021 Q2","e":"fss","d":"2021-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jennifer L. Sherman","x":"We also work diligently to mitigate the impacts by implementing several price increases and surcharges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/federal-signal-corp-fss-q2-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"FSS 2021 Q2","e":"fss","d":"2021-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jennifer L. Sherman","x":"But with the pricing actions we have taken, we are expecting to see improvement beginning in the fourth quarter with more price realization expected as our backlog turns.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/federal-signal-corp-fss-q2-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"FSS 2021 Q2","e":"fss","d":"2021-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ian A. Hudson","x":"As a reminder, in the prior year quarter, we also took several cost saving actions in response to the uncertainty created by the pandemic, which reduced our costs in Q2 last year by approximately $14 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/federal-signal-corp-fss-q2-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"FSS 2021 Q2","e":"fss","d":"2021-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ian A. Hudson","x":"Other items affecting the quarterly results include a $1.3 million reduction in restructuring charges, a $2.3 million decrease in other expense and a $700,000 reduction in interest expense.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/federal-signal-corp-fss-q2-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"FSS 2021 Q3","e":"fss","d":"2021-11-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ian A. Hudson","x":"With the various pricing actions we have taken, including repricing of our backlog at a number of businesses, we are expecting to see improvement beginning in the fourth quarter with more price realization expected as our backlog turns.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/09/federal-signal-corp-fss-q3-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"FSS 2021 Q3","e":"fss","d":"2021-11-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jennifer L. Sherman","x":"We have, I mean, nobody likes higher prices, but we've been very successful in terms of doing a number 